[[Kuunavang]] was trapped under the [[Harvest Temple]] by [[Shiro Tagachi]]'s death, eventually becoming corrupted by his influence. In the [[Unwaking Waters]], the [[Kurzick]]s and the [[Luxon]]s must unite to defeat her so they can use her powers against Shiro.

