==Dialogue==
;Harvest Temple
:''"You helped me in my hour of need, and now I am at your service."''

;Divine Path
:''"Shiro will trouble us no longer. The [[envoy]]s have taken him to a [[Realm of Torment|special place]] in [[the Underworld]] where he will pay for his crimes for all eternity."''

;Raisu Palace mission and explorable area and Imperial Sanctum
:''"I have perceived your need and I am here. I can once again provide you with temporary powers. Do you wish it?"''
:{{yes}} Yes, please.
:{{no|ingame}} No, thank you.

After receiving a Celestial skill
:''"You have already received all the help I can provide. Now go, your task is one that cannot wait."''

==Notes==
*Kuunavang is resistant to [[interrupt]]s. It may take two or more consecutive tries to actually interrupt her skills.
*This creature has a [[Miniature Kuunavang|miniature version]].
*This creature has a [[Everlasting Kuunavang Tonic|tonic form]].

==Trivia==
{{gw2w}}
*At the end of the [[Factions Preview Event]], Kuunavang, a [[Shiro'ken Elementalist]] and a [[Shiro'ken Warrior]] appeared and killed all the players in [[Cavalon]] and [[House zu Heltzer]].
*After the players uncorrupt her, she becomes the second uncorrupted major Saltspray Dragon, after [[Albax]].

